OL,3,GNEWSADrivers who killed mum and girl
OL,4,Awhile racing jailed
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo men who killed a mother and her
OL,7,Ffour-year-old daughter as they raced
OL,8,Ftheir high-performance cars along a
OL,9,FLeeds city centre road have been
OL,10,Fjailed.
OL,12,FJustyna Hulboj, 27, and her daughter
OL,13,FLena Czepczor were killed when they
OL,14,Fwere hit by an Audi TT RS as they
OL,15,Fwalked to the girl's nursery on the A61
OL,16,FScott Hall Road on 16 January 2023.
OL,18,FAt Leeds Crown Court on Monday, Hardeep
OL,19,FBhachu, 29, was jailed for 12 years and
OL,20,FJasskamal Riyat, 37, for 16 years.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
